<section class="faq-section" id="FAQ">
  <div class="container faq-container">
    <div class="section-header text-center">
      <span class="section-tag">Got Questions?</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Everything you need to know about the JECQCUPG Upgraded Ergonomic Chair, shipping, warranty, and assembly.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-accordion-list">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-question">How difficult is the assembly, and do I need my own tools?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            Assembly is exceptionally straightforward and typically takes <strong>15 to 20 minutes</strong>. Everything you need is included directly in the box: hex keys, screws with pre-applied threadlock, spare hardware, and step-by-step illustrated instructions. No power tools are required.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-question">What is the weight limit, and what heights is this chair recommended for?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            The JECQCUPG chair is engineered with a reinforced alloy steel frame and a certified <strong>SGS Class-4 heavy-duty gas cylinder rated up to 400 lbs (181 kg)</strong>. The seat height range (45cm &ndash; 53cm) and high backrest (82cm) comfortably accommodate users from <strong>5'2" up to 6'4" (157cm to 193cm)</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-question">How do the synchronized linkage armrests work?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            Standard chairs have static armrests attached only to the base or seat. When you recline back, your elbows are left hanging in empty air. Our <strong>synchronized linkage armrests</strong> connect both the seat and backrest through steel pivot joints. As you lean back from 90° to 135°, the armrests automatically adjust their angle and glide back with your arms, keeping your elbows fully supported at all times.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-question">What is special about the 16-pocket spring cushion?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            Instead of relying entirely on slab foam (which compresses completely under body weight over time), the JECQCUPG seat uses <strong>16 individually encased pocket coils</strong>, exactly like a premium mattress, surrounded by 50D high-resilience foam. Each spring responds independently to your body weight, dispersing pelvic pressure and preventing soreness, even during 12+ hour sessions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-question">How does the 30-Day Risk-Free In-Home Trial work?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            We want you to experience genuine ergonomic relief in your everyday work and gaming setup. Once your chair arrives, test it for 30 full days. If you're not completely amazed by the comfort and quality, contact our support team and we will coordinate an easy return with a 100% refund.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-question">How fast is shipping, and where does it ship from?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">{% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down' %}</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>
            All orders are processed and dispatched within <strong>24 business hours</strong> from our domestic distribution warehouses. Standard shipping is 100% <strong>FREE</strong> and delivery takes approximately <strong>2 to 4 business days</strong> with full carrier tracking sent to your email.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ Section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "Frequently Asked Questions"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "FAQ Section"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
